hadiths[56]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3905","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har insaan ka parinda us ki gardan mein hai."
"3906","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein se aik giroh hai jinhein zameen mein dhansa diya jayega; wo aik aadmi ki taraf bheje jayenge jo Makka aayega to Allah taala use rok dega aur unhein dhansa dega; un ki halakat ki jagah aik hai aur un ke nikalne ki jagahein juda hain; beshak un mein se koi majboor hoga to majboor hokar aayega."
"3907","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Imam ki itaat musalman aadmi par haq hai jab tak wo Allah ki nafarmani ka hukm na de; phir jab wo Allah ki nafarmani ka hukm de to us ki itaat nahi."
"3908","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do ka khana teen ke liye kaafi hai aur teen ka khana chaar ke liye kaafi hai."
"3909","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Do ka khana chaar ke liye kaafi hai aur chaar ka khana aath ke liye kaafi hai; pas us par jama ho aur juda na ho."
"3910","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aik ka khana do ke liye kaafi hai, do ka khana chaar ke liye kaafi hai aur chaar ka khana aath ke liye kaafi hai."
"3911","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khana khane se aur bartan bartan se."
"3912","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khana us ke khane jaise aur bartan us ke bartan jaise."
"3913","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ilm talab karna har musalman par farz hai."
"3914","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ilm talab karna har musalman par farz hai; aur ilm ke talabgar ke liye har cheez maghfirat mangti hai yahan tak ke samundar mein machhliyan."
"3915","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Talha shaheed hain jo zameen ke chehre par chalte hain."
"3916","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Talha un mein se hain jinhon ne apni nazar poori ki."
"3917","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tumhara Baitullah ka tawaf aur Safa-Marwa ke darmiyan sa'i tumhare hajj aur umre ke liye kaafi hai."
"3918","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tooba jannat mein darakht hai sau saal ki musafat ka; ehl-e-jannat ke kapre us ki tehniyon se niklenge."
"3919","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Maseeh ke baad ki zindagi ke liye khushkhabri: aasmaan ko baarish ki ijazat di jayegi aur zameen ko paidawar ki ijazat di jayegi yahan tak ke agar tum apna beej pathar par bogo to ugega; aur yahan tak ke aadmi sher par se guzrega to wo use nuqsan nahi pahuncha sakta, saanp par pair rakhega to wo use nuqsan nahi pahuncha sakta; na jhagra hoga, na hasad, na bughz."
"3920","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Shaam ke liye khushkhabri; kyunke Rahman ke farishte us par apne par phailaye hue hain."
"3921","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ajnabi logon ke liye khushkhabri: naik log bure bahut se logon mein; un ki nafarmani karne wale un ki itaat karne walon se zyada honge."
"3922","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ke liye khushkhabri jo mujhe pa kar mujh par iman laya; aur us ke liye khushkhabri jo mujhe nahi pa saka phir mujh par iman laya."
"3923","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ke liye khushkhabri jo mujhe dekhe aur mujh par iman laye; phir khushkhabri, phir khushkhabri, phir khushkhabri us ke liye jo mujh par iman laye aur mujhe na dekhe."
"3924","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ke liye khushkhabri jo mujhe dekhe aur mujh par iman laye aik baar; aur us ke liye khushkhabri jo mujhe na dekhe aur mujh par iman laye saat baar."
"3925","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ke liye khushkhabri jo mujhe dekhe aur mujh par iman laye; aur us ke liye khushkhabri jo mujh par iman laye aur mujhe na dekhe, teen baar."
"3926","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ke liye khushkhabri jo mujhe dekhe aur mujh par iman laye; aur us ke liye khushkhabri jo use dekhe jo mujhe dekhe, aur us ke liye jo use dekhe jo use dekhe jo mujhe dekhe aur mujh par iman laye; un ke liye khushkhabri aur achcha thikana."
"3927","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ke liye khushkhabri jo mujhe dekhe, aur us ke liye jo use dekhe jo mujhe dekhe, aur us ke liye jo use dekhe jo use dekhe jo mujhe dekhe."
"3928","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ke liye khushkhabri jis ki umar lambi ho aur amal achcha ho."
"3929","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ke liye khushkhabri jo apni zaban ka malik ho, us ka ghar use kaafi ho aur apne gunah par roye."
"3930","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ke liye khushkhabri jo apne aamaal-naame mein kasrat se istighfar paye."
"3931","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ke liye khushkhabri jo Islam ki hidayat paye, us ki zindagi guzare ke mutabiq ho aur us par qana'at kare."
"3932","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Logon ke peeche se tawaf karo jabke tum sawaar ho."
"3933","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum mein se kisi ke bartan ki taharat jab us mein kutta munh daale ye hai ke use saat baar dhoye, un mein pehli mitti se."
"3934","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har khaal ki taharat us ki dabaghat hai."
"3935","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne sehan paak karo; kyunke Yahudi apne sehan paak nahi karte."
"3936","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: In jismon ko paak karo, Allah tumhein paak karega; kyunke jo banda paak sokar raat guzarta hai wo is haal mein sota hai ke us ke bistar mein farishta hota hai; raat ki jis ghari wo palat-ta hai wo kehta hai: Ae Allah, apne bande ko bakhsh de; kyunke wo paak sokar raha."
"3937","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mardon ki khushbu wo jis ki boo zahir ho aur rang chhupa ho; aur aurton ki khushbu wo jis ka rang zahir ho aur boo chhupi ho."
"3938","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Har bande ka parinda us ki gardan mein hai."
"3939","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne munh miswak se khushbudar karo; kyunke ye Quran ke raaste hain."
"3940","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne munh khushbudar karo; kyunke tumhare munh Quran ka raasta hain."
"3941","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne sehan khushbudar karo; kyunke gande-tareen sehan Yahudiyon ke sehan hain."
"3942","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khane wala shukr karne wala sabr karne wale rozedar ke darje mein hai."
"3943","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khane wale shukr karne wale ke liye sabr karne wale rozedar ke ajr jaise hai."
"3944","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Taoon gandagi ki alamat hai jis se Allah ne apne bandon mein se logon ko aazmaya; pas jab tum use suno to us mein dakhil na ho; aur jab wo zameen mein waaqe ho aur tum us mein ho to us se bhaag kar na niklo."
"3945","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Taoon gandagi ya azab ka baqiyya hai jo bani Israel ke giroh par bheja gaya; pas jab wo zameen mein waaqe ho aur tum us mein ho to us se bhaag kar na niklo; aur jab wo zameen mein waaqe ho aur tum us mein na ho to us mein na utro."
"3946","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Taoon meri ummat ke liye shahadat hai aur jinno mein se tumhare dushmanon ka chubhna hai: oont ki gilty jaise gilty jo baghalon aur narm jagahon mein nikalti hai; jo us mein mare wo shaheed mar gaya; jo us mein thehra wo Allah ke raaste mein murabit jaise tha; aur jo us se bhaaga wo laraai se bhaagne wale jaise tha."
"3947","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Taoon har musalman ke liye shahadat hai."
"3948","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Taoon oont ki gilty jaise gilty hai; us mein theherne wala shaheed jaise hai aur us se bhaagne wala laraai se bhaagne wale jaise hai."
"3949","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Taoon azab tha jo Allah jis par chahta bhejta tha; aur Allah ne use mominon ke liye rehmat banaya; pas jo taoon mein mubtela ho aur apne sheher mein sabr aur ajr ki ummeed rakhte hue thehre aur jaane ke use siwa wo nahi pahunchega jo Allah ne us ke liye likha hai, to us ke liye shaheed ke ajr jaise hoga."
"3950","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Taoon, doobna, pet ki bimari, jalna aur bacha jante hue marna meri ummat ke liye shahadat hai."
"3951","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Taoon jinno mein se tumhare dushmanon ka chubhna hai aur wo tumhare liye shahadat hai."
"3952","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Khana khane se barabar barabar."
"3953","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Zakhm, taoon, chat girna, darinde ka khana, doobna, jalna, pet ki bimari aur pehlu ka waram shahadat hai."
"3954","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Baitullah ka tawaf namaz hai lekin Allah ne us mein guftagu halal ki hai; pas jo bole to khair ke siwa na bole."
"3955","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Baitullah ke gird tawaf namaz jaise hai magar ye ke tum us mein baat karte ho; pas jo us mein baat kare to khair ke siwa baat na kare."
"3956","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tawaf namaz hai; pas us mein guftagu kam karo."
"3957","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Taharat iman ka aadha hai; Alhamdulillah meezaan ko bhar deta hai; Subhanallah aur Alhamdulillah aasmaan aur zameen ke darmiyan ko bhar dete hain; namaz noor hai; sadqa daleel hai; sabr roshni hai; Quran daleel hai tumhare liye ya tum par; sab log subah karte hain to apne nafs ko bechne wale hain: use aazaad karne wale ya halaak karne wale."
"3958","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Talaq us ke haath mein hai jo pindli pakre."
"3959","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Parinde taqdeer se chalte hain."
"3960","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Bad-shaguni shirk hai."
